{"4339590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Clean Start", "steam_appid": 4339590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no clean beginning here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO CLEAN START is a single-player psychological survival experience built around repetition, failure, and learning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not meant to win on your first attempt.<br>You are meant to observe, adapt, and try again — changed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to what you do.<br>It remembers your actions, your mistakes, and your patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run reshapes the experience, not through numbers or upgrades, but through understanding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Philosophy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO CLEAN START avoids traditional hand-holding.<br>There is no excessive HUD, no explicit guidance, and no power fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information is earned through attention, not tutorials.<br>Failure is expected — and often necessary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Structure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around repeated attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not a restart.<br>It is a continuation — carrying knowledge, consequences, and subtle changes forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Status</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO CLEAN START is currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playable demo is planned for <strong>February</strong>.<br>Development is being shared openly, with frequent updates and transparent design decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no clean beginning here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO CLEAN START is a single-player psychological survival experience built around repetition, failure, and learning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not meant to win on your first attempt.<br>You are meant to observe, adapt, and try again — changed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to what you do.<br>It remembers your actions, your mistakes, and your patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run reshapes the experience, not through numbers or upgrades, but through understanding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Philosophy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO CLEAN START avoids traditional hand-holding.<br>There is no excessive HUD, no explicit guidance, and no power fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information is earned through attention, not tutorials.<br>Failure is expected — and often necessary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Structure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around repeated attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not a restart.<br>It is a continuation — carrying knowledge, consequences, and subtle changes forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Status</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO CLEAN START is currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playable demo is planned for <strong>February</strong>.<br>Development is being shared openly, with frequent updates and transparent design decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "This is not a clean start. Explore a hostile world that reacts to your actions and remembers your mistakes. Learn through observation, failure, and persistence. Each new run is not a reset — it’s a transformation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339590/0b8af31b70185911e7166005d0da603332945d00/header.jpg?t=1784817472", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339590/5c67c57e9aa583f7024a0ec8b427fa304fd272ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784817472", "capsule_image